<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">管理员</view><view class="title">系统设置</view><view class="subtitle">用户、基础资料、汇率和审计状态</view></view><view class="notice">涉及密钥、短信、OCR 和邮件凭证的设置不会在小程序展示明文，须在受控网页端配置。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><picker range="{{sourceNames}}" value="{{sourceIndex}}" bindchange="chooseSource"><view class="picker">{{sourceNames[sourceIndex]}}<text>⌄</text></view></picker><input class="input search" value="{{keyword}}" bindinput="search" placeholder="搜索设置记录"/><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取设置…</view><view wx:elif="{{!rows.length}}" class="card empty">暂无设置记录或当前账号无权读取。</view><view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="section-title">{{item.title}}</view><view wx:for="{{item.lines}}" wx:for-item="line" wx:key="label" class="line"><text>{{line.label}}</text><strong>{{line.value}}</strong></view></view></view>
